All code for simulation studies, real data analyses, and figure generation is provided in `code_and_data.zip`. Precomputed results are organized in `result_data` directories, allowing figures to be reproduced without rerunning the full analyses. The plotting scripts are organized by analysis type and load the corresponding precomputed results. Before running the scripts, users should set the working directory to the appropriate project folder, as described in the README file.


