#### Libraries and dependencies used by the code

The code was implemented in R version 4.4.2. The following R packages were used: ggplot2 (4.0.2), tidyr (1.3.2), dplyr (1.2.0), readr (2.2.0), stringr (1.6.0), tibble (3.3.1), tidyverse (2.0.0), data.table (1.18.2.1), readxl (1.4.5), openxlsx (4.2.8.1), zoo (1.8.15), mgcv (1.9.4), gridExtra (2.3), digest (0.6.39), xtable (1.8.8), ggh4x (0.3.1), GrFA (0.2.2), ncvreg (3.16.0), Matrix (1.7.4), glmnet (4.1.10), SIS (0.8.8), MASS (7.3.65), ACAT (0.91), metap (1.13), harmonicmeanp (3.0.1), clusterProfiler (4.14.6), and org.Hs.eg.db (3.20.0). The ACAT package was obtained from GitHub (yaowuliu/ACAT), while clusterProfiler and org.Hs.eg.db were obtained from Bioconductor.
  
